              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Soup Loving Nicole"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made this for a salad dressing only and it was excellent! I used red onion for the onion and I just can't say enough about this. Excellent! It looks too thick but it is not. Thanks for sharing!",
            "datePublished": "2017-01-11T05:33:13.933Z"
